      "body": "## What broke\r\n\r\nAfter the speculative kernels moved to JIT by #40033 , their input check only admitted NVIDIA tensors. AMD tensors were rejected before any GPU work started.  `test_basic_sanity_eagle3.py` fails https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35292247566/job/105499225679#logs\r\n<img width=\"2885\" height=\"1671\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/86fd9eee-1f5a-4acd-ab8d-4e80fe71f868\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## Fix\r\n\r\nUse the existing platform-neutral GPU type in the four new checks. It maps to CUDA on NVIDIA and ROCm on AMD, so NVIDIA behavior stays unchanged.\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\nTest passed\r\n<img width=\"1719\" height=\"1197\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e76d20d5-da23-4ad0-a7a8-78416520f42a\" />\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35318336800/job/105514997642\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:no_entry_sign: [Run #35318322132](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35318322132)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #35321672989](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35321672989)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #35318322220](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35318322220)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
